@SmartX.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

### Get all sensors (should be empty at first)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/sensors
Accept: application/json

### Register a new sensor
POST {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "A1:B2:C3:D4:E5:F6",
  "location": "Greenhouse 3 / Zone B",
  "category": "Environmental"
}

### Get all sensors again (should now show one)
GET {{SmartX.Api_HostAddress}}/sensors
Accept: application/json